{"unit_id":"edfrey0044__dsh-unarchive#card-zh","repo":"edfrey0044/dsh-unarchive","commit":"69b1bee8170929b66faa544da14711bf8eb90cb4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-unarchive 是一个适用于 DSH 的会话管理插件，提供命令和 agent 工具两种入口。它通过读取工作区归档会话集合，并在支持时调用 workspaceRegistry 的恢复接口，或写入工作区存储，将会话从归档集合移除。用户可以查看归档会话及可用标题、按会话 ID 恢复会话，也可以在 agent 对话中请求列出或恢复。适合需要找回误归档会话的 DSH 用户。无需 API 密钥或额外账号；需安装到 profile。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:60-88","lib/index.js:125-149","lib/index.js:187-215","cordis.patch.yml:8-10"]}
{"unit_id":"edfrey0044__dsh-unarchive#card-en","repo":"edfrey0044/dsh-unarchive","commit":"69b1bee8170929b66faa544da14711bf8eb90cb4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-unarchive restores archived DSH sessions through a command or agent tool. It lists archived IDs with available titles and restores a session by ID. It uses the workspace registry API when available, with a storage fallback. Install it in a DSH profile; no API key or account is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:60-88","lib/index.js:125-149","lib/index.js:187-215","cordis.patch.yml:8-10"]}
