{"unit_id":"edfrey0044__dsh-unarchive#feature-1","repo":"edfrey0044/dsh-unarchive","commit":"69b1bee8170929b66faa544da14711bf8eb90cb4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-unarchive 的功能「查看归档会话」：显示当前归档集合中的会话 ID，并在可用时附上标题。可运行 /unarchive，或调用工具时省略 sessionId；没有归档项时会提示列表为空。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:99-132","lib/index.js:157-161","lib/index.js:174-178"]}
{"unit_id":"edfrey0044__dsh-unarchive#feature-2","repo":"edfrey0044/dsh-unarchive","commit":"69b1bee8170929b66faa544da14711bf8eb90cb4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-unarchive 的功能「按 ID 恢复会话」：从工作区归档集合移除指定会话 ID，使其重新出现在工作区。可向 /unarchive 传入 ID，或调用 unarchive_session 并提供 sessionId。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:72-88","lib/index.js:157-165","lib/index.js:174-180"]}
{"unit_id":"edfrey0044__dsh-unarchive#feature-3","repo":"edfrey0044/dsh-unarchive","commit":"69b1bee8170929b66faa544da14711bf8eb90cb4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-unarchive 的功能「兼容恢复接口」：优先使用 workspaceRegistry.unarchiveSession；接口不可用时，改写 workspace 存储中的归档 ID 集合。回退方式可能造成重启前缓存不同步。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:38-41","lib/index.js:72-88","lib/index.js:141-149"]}
{"unit_id":"edfrey0044__dsh-unarchive#feature-4","repo":"edfrey0044/dsh-unarchive","commit":"69b1bee8170929b66faa544da14711bf8eb90cb4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-unarchive 的功能「恢复时显示会话标题」：列出归档项时尝试从持久化列表和 projection cache 读取标题；数据不可用或读取失败时退回只显示会话 ID。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:99-117","lib/index.js:125-132"]}
{"unit_id":"edfrey0044__dsh-unarchive#caveat-1","repo":"edfrey0044/dsh-unarchive","commit":"69b1bee8170929b66faa544da14711bf8eb90cb4","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-unarchive 在缺少核心恢复接口时会直接写 workspace 存储；注册表内存缓存可能到重启后才同步，重启前刷新界面或修改工作区可能再次隐藏该会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:18-20","lib/index.js:80-88","lib/index.js:141-149"]}
